codex
A stronger idea is radial Rao-Blackwellization. Because every layer is positively homogeneous in the input, the Gaussian radius can be integrated out exactly: sample only directions and multiply by the exact mean radius. I’m testing that now and disabling the failed squared control.
apply patch
